  "job_B15.6.15_20251003_114329": {
    "text": "\u00c6\u00feelgifu cy\u00f0 hire cwide hire cynehlaforde, & hire hl\u00e6fdian, & hire freondon, hw\u00e6t hio gode wile don,\n\u00de\u00e6t is hyre hlaforde \u00feam cynge xxx mancessa goldes, & twegen stedan, \u00fee him to beodonne bio\u00f0, &\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t westwicum swa gewered, & \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t G\u00e6tesdene into sancte Albane, on \u00fea gerad\nAnd xxx mancessa goldes & xxx oxana, xx of g\u00e6tesd\u00e6ne & x of acyrsce, & xx cuna, x of g\u00e6tesdene x of\nAnd o\u00f0er healf hund sceapa of Langaforda, l ewna mid heora lambum & l gyldscepa & \u00e6t Acyrsce ane\nAnd frige mon of \u00feam tune Ymman, & Ealdelm, & Wulfhelm, & his bearn, & Siwynne gingran sunu, &\nAnd twa sealfrene cuppan & twegen hornas & ane boc & \u00fe\u00e6t betste wahrift & \u00fe\u00e6t betste setr\u00e6gl for hio,\n\u00c6t G\u00e6tesdene fryoge mon Eadmund & his sunu & Heahulf & Eadwig, \u00c6\u00feelwine & his wif selle mon\nWynstan & Heremod & Cu\u00f0mundes dohter & Osmund & his wif into Sancte Albane.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t langaforda \u00e6lfno\u00f0e his d\u00e6g, & V men.\nAnd Mangod & Mantat freo.\nAnd Wine mylnere & \u00fe\u00e6s swanes sunu & wif & \u00feone gingran sceaphyrde h\u00e6bbe \u00e6lfno\u00f0, & cc sceapa,\nAnd ofor his d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Langaforda \u00e6t Langaforda into Hyccan.\nAnd Leofwine mire swyster suna \u00fe\u00e6t lon \u00e6t Cliftune him & Eadric & his wif, & freoge mon heora cild.\nAnd L ewna mid heora lombum into Hiccan of Langaforda & L sceapa into Bedaforda & xxx to Flittan,\nGe\u00feence mon \u00fea nehtw\u00e6ccan mid \u00feam oforeacan & hire preoston.\n& \u00fea healfan hide \u00fee Wineman ahte into \u00fe\u00e6re cyrcan & freoge mon Eadwine preost & h\u00e6bbe he \u00fea\n& freoge man Ufic & \u00feone fullere.\nByrhstanes swustur into standune, Eadwine on \u00fea gerad \u00fee heo & hire hlaford habban \u00e6lce gere on\n& freoge man Tiddulf & Bogan & Domic & his wif & Siric & his steopdohtur.\n& \u00e6lfwy\u00f0e h\u00e6bbe Eadwine freo & hire cild & \u00fe\u00e6s mylneres wif & hire cild.\nGif \u00fe\u00e6r oforeaca sy, d\u00e6le hit mon hire hirede.\n\u00de\u00e6t lond \u00e6t Mundene h\u00e6bbe Alfwold his d\u00e6g on \u00fea gerad \u00fee he selle \u00e6lce lengtene to Brahingum vi\n& h\u00e6bbe twa sylh\u00f0a oxana & iiii w\u00e6pmen Oswig & his wif & Cinesige & his wif, & freoge mon heora\nSelle man to Heortfordingabyrig iiii oxan & to Welingum iiii of \u00feam tune & \u00e6lfwolde x cy.\nGif \u00fe\u00e6r eaca sy, selle mon Manne ii.\n& freoge mon Bogan & his hiwisc eal, & Winsige & his wif, & Man & his wif, & Dufan \u00fea ealdan &\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t Mundene ofor \u00e6lfwoldes d\u00e6g, sille hit mon healf into Brachingum, healf into\n& \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t Standune Leofsige.\nAnd selle man to Brachingum iiii oxsan & ii cy \u00feanan of.\nAnd freoge man Eatstan swan, & healde his sunu \u00fea heorde & freoge man elles \u00fe\u00e6t hiwisc, & Grim &\nAnd h\u00e6bbe Leofsige \u00fe\u00e6ne gingran swan & \u00fea heorde \u00fee Eatstan healt.\nAnd selle man \u00fe\u00e6r of tune Wulfrice huntan ii oxsan, & twa cy.\nAnd h\u00e6bbe Leofsige eal \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er his d\u00e6g, & \u00e6fter his d\u00e6ge sylle hit man Alfwolde, ofor heora d\u00e6g\nAnd hy gesingon for hy & for hire hlafordes sawle \u00e6lce gere xxx m\u00e6ssana, & xxx saltera, & \u00e6fre \u00fea\nSelle man Leofsige \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Offanlege & eal \u00fe\u00e6t seo boc t\u00e6c\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t Twingum him to\nAnd of Standune anne oman wines, & xx cysa, & vi swin, & an hry\u00f0er.\nAnd nyme man of \u00e6ghwilcum tune to \u00feam \u00feryttygu\u00fean d\u00e6ge gelice mycel ge of G\u00e6desdene ge of\nAnd freoge man \u00e6t Offanlege Cyneleofe, & M\u00e6rtin & his wif, & Deormod & his wif, & Bryhtware, &\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Weodune h\u00e6bbe Leofsige on \u00fea gerad \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6lce geare l\u00e6de ane tunnan fulle ealo\u00f0\nGif he bearn h\u00e6bbe, selle hit him, gif he n\u00e6bbe, selle hit on his riht cyn.\nAnd freoge man Leofric \u00e6t Weowdune, & \u00e6lfric, & Bryhtelm, & his sweostor.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Offanlege selle his cilde.\nGif he cild n\u00e6bbe be rihtwife selle hit mon into Sancte Albane butan \u00feam lande \u00fee Tatulf on sit, &\nSelle mon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lfgyfe hire hlafordes dohtur gif heo libbe.\nGif heo ne lybbe, selle hit mon into Sancte Albane.\nAnd singe man \u00e6lce gere xxx m\u00e6ssena, & xxx saltera feor hy & for hire hlafordes sawle.\nAnd heo bit hire hl\u00e6fdian hyre to \u00e6lmessan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hine bewite, & he mote fylgan \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelinge & ne\nAnd \u00e6lfwolde \u00feone hagan healfne on Lundanne & \u00e6lfhege healfne.\nAnd \u00e6lfgife selle man ane heorde swina \u00e6t G\u00e6tesdene & \u00feone gingran swan & twegen men \u00fe\u00e6t to.\nAnd Leofwine mire swustur sunu selle mon \u00fea heorde \u00fee Brihtelm heold, & his ginra sunu & Wulfstan\nAnd selle man Leofrune mire m\u00e6gan, \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Wadforda & \u00e6t Weodune ii men & viii oxsan, & hire\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t Watforda ofor hire d\u00e6g hire dehter Godwife.\n\u00c6t \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00e6t \u00ferope selle ofor hire d\u00e6g innan hire agen cyn on \u00fea gerad \u00fee heo selle hire wed & \u00e6lc\nGif heo nelle, d\u00e6le hit man hire cildon.\nAnd Wulfwunne mire m\u00e6gan ane bledu & anne preon & an wahrift & an sethregl & eal betstow swylce\nAnd Wulfm\u00e6re hire m\u00e6ge \u00fea l\u00e6ssan seolfrenan cuppan.\nAnd ceorfe man of hire bende Witsige v mancessas buton heo hit \u00e6r gedon h\u00e6fde, & v Leofwine\nAnd selle mon Beornwynne minne bl\u00e6wenan cyrtel is nea\u00feene unrenod, & hire betstan heafodgew\u00e6do.\nAnd selle man lufetate & \u00e6lfgifu & godwife hire iii godwebbenan cyrtlas & wulfgife selle mon o\u00f0era\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00fean d\u00e6len hiredwifmen \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er him betwinum, & selle man Leofsige iii wahrift swylce \u00fe\u00e6r\nAnd d\u00e6le Godwif & \u00e6lfgifu \u00fea o\u00f0ra him betwinum, & hira \u00e6g\u00feer ii mydercan.\nAnd Leofsige hire ferdw\u00e6n & fo him si\u00f0\u00feon to eallum \u00feam sta\u00f0ule & sitte \u00fe\u00e6ron.\nAnd freoge mon Man hire goldsmi\u00f0, & his eldestan sunu, & \u00feone ginstan, & his wif, & Wulfrices wif,\nAnd freoge mon Leofrune on \u00fe\u00e6t ilce rad & \u00c6\u00feelfl\u00e6de.\nAnd freoge mon Liofing \u00e6t Heanhl\u00e6we & h\u00e6bbe his land on \u00fe\u00e6t gerad \u00fee he \u00e6lce gare gemune hy &\nAnd freoge mon Mannes cnapan.\nAnd heo byt for godes lufon \u00fe\u00e6t mon of \u00fe\u00e6re manlafe of Mundene & \u00e6t G\u00e6tesdene & of Langanforda\nFreoge mon \u00fe\u00e6ne sceaphirde, & h\u00e6bbe alfwold \u00fea d\u00e6gan.\n& gemune mon \u00c6\u00feeric hire godsunu mid suman men, & selle mon \u00c6\u00feelwearde preoste \u00fe\u00e6ne l\u00e6ssan\nAnd selle mon Gundbu\u00fee \u00c6\u00feelfer\u00fees sunu se healta cnapa.\nAnd Bogan hire preoste finde him mon of \u00fe\u00e6re lafe anne gionne mannan gif \u00fe\u00e6r sy.\nGif ne selle mon of Offanlege ane cu.\nAnd h\u00e6bbe Leofsige \u00c6\u00feelwynne & Si\u00f0emon & his wif & \u00c6\u00feewine & his wif, & freoge mon hira cild\n\u00c6lfgife hire magan Cynewynne dohtor, & Godwife Eadwynne & Byrnfl\u00e6de butan heo sealf heo frige\nEall se freot & eall seo \u00e6lmesse \u00fee her gecweden is, hyo wile \u00fe\u00e6t hit beo heore \u00e6lmessa for \u00feon hit\nAnd heo bit hire cynehlaford him to \u00e6lmissan for his cynescipe for godes lufan & for Sancte Marigan\nLeof hit becw\u00e6\u00f0 hire hlaford hire to sellanne \u00feam \u00fee hyo wolde, \u00fee ne gelefde hire hire hlafordes\n\u00dea l\u00e6dde heo a\u00f0 to Hyccan, xx hund a\u00f0a.\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00e6lfere on & \u00e6lfsige cild & Byrnric w\u00e6s \u00fea gerefa, & ealle \u00fea yldestan men to Bedanforda, &\nUfonan \u00feone cwide & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea of \u00e6rdo de Eadelm hire hlafordes swustur sunu hire lond hire \u00e6t\n\u00dea sohte ic \u00fe\u00e6ne cing & gesealde hym xx punda.\n\u00dea agef he me myn lond on his un\u00feonc.\nHeo ne anbit na hyre cynehlaforde ne hire hl\u00e6fdian, ac gif hwa bidde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0es cwide standan ne mote,\nButon hio hit get self awende, & \u00fea ne lybben \u00fee hit nu becweden ys.",
